          "kind": "class",
          "description": "A drag-and-drop kanban board. Pass an array of `columns`, each with a\n`title` and an ordered list of `cards`. Columns render side by side; each is\na labelled region containing a list (role=\"list\") of draggable cards\n(role=\"listitem\").\n\nCards move with native buttons, native HTML5 drag and drop, or keyboard pickup.\nThe buttons provide a single-pointer alternative to dragging. Press a\ncard and drop it onto another card or column. With the keyboard, focus a card\nand press Space to pick it up, then ArrowLeft / ArrowRight to move it along\nthe rendered column track (including RTL) and ArrowUp / ArrowDown to reorder\nwithin a column; press Space again to drop or Escape to cancel. Every move is\nannounced through a polite aria-live region.\n\nEither way the board updates its internal `columns` state and emits\n`fluid-move` with the card id, source column, target column, and target\nindex.",
          "name": "FluidKanban",
          "cssProperties": [
            {
              "description": "Gap between columns and between cards. Falls back to --fluid-space-md.",
              "name": "--fluid-kanban-gap"
            },
            {
              "description": "Corner radius of columns and cards. Falls back to --fluid-radius-md.",
              "name": "--fluid-kanban-radius"
            },
            {
              "description": "Column background. Falls back to --fluid-surface-muted.",
              "name": "--fluid-kanban-column-bg"
            },
            {
              "description": "Card background. Falls back to --fluid-surface-base.",
              "name": "--fluid-kanban-card-bg"
            },
            {
              "description": "Text color. Falls back to --fluid-text-primary.",
              "name": "--fluid-kanban-fg"
